# The goldens are compared byte for byte, so git must not translate their line
# endings on checkout. The unattend answer files are LF and the bootstrap
# scripts are CRLF, deliberately; a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true --
# which is the default on GitHub's windows runners -- rewrites the LF ones into
# CRLF and then every case differs from its golden, while the diff reports
# equal line counts because `str::lines` drops the trailing CR.
crates/**/testdata/** -text
